  }
  location /assets/ {
       proxy_pass http://example.com/assets/; 
  }
  location /styles/ {
       proxy_pass http://example.com/styles/; 

```

give up using a  example.com as subdirectory on example.net and instead host it on a subdomain of example.net:

```
